# Scoped repo: this Drive folder is 25 GB of documents, archives, spreadsheets,
# personal records, and a nested git repo. NONE of that is tracked.
#
# This repository exists for ONE reason: BROYHILLGOP_BOOT.md and its companion
# governance documents are the platform's constitution, they are edited by more than
# one agent, and until 2026-08-31 they had no version history at all. An overwrite
# was unrecoverable. Now it is not.
#
# Default: ignore everything. Then re-admit governance documents by name.
/*
!.gitignore
!BROYHILLGOP_BOOT.md
!BroyhillGOP-Constitution-v2.md
!BroyhillGOP-Automated-Approval-System.md
!START_HERE.md

# Never track, regardless of any rule above:
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.zip
*.pdf
*.docx
*.gdoc
